  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.5-preview: Dynamic SOUL.md Learning\n\nNew Features:\n- Dynamic SOUL.md personality learning: agents can now update and persist their personality during runtime\n- ISoulLoader.ReloadSoulAsync() for reloading personality from disk\n- IPersistentSoulLoader interface for read-write SOUL implementations\n- Agent.UpdateSoulAsync() methods for updating personality with optional persistence\n- FileSystemSoulLoader.ToMarkdown() for serializing SoulDocument back to markdown\n- DynamicSOUL sample demonstrating personality learning over conversations\n- CustomLoaderDemo sample showing custom loader patterns and templates\n- Full customization support: users can implement ISoulLoader for any data source (database, API, cloud storage, etc.)\n\nBreaking Changes: None\n\nRelated: FileSystemSoulLoader now implements IPersistentSoulLoader",
